  "goodToKnow": "Die Quellenangabe is a citation or reference: Fotos ohne Quellenangabe, korrekte Quellenangaben in einer Hausarbeit. Missing citations led to the plagiarism scandals of several German politicians, such as Karl-Theodor zu Guttenberg in 2011, uncovered by the VroniPlag and GuttenPlag wikis. Related: die Fußnote, das Literaturverzeichnis (bibliography). Plural: die Quellenangaben."
